        "url": "https://ypen.gov.gr/",
        "description": "Precautionary location protection applied to limit dissemination of precise coordinates for a location-sensitive taxon potentially vulnerable to targeted disturbance. Native orchid species occurring in Greece are protected under Presidential Decree 67/1981 (national), Council Regulation (EC) No 338/97 (European Union), and CITES Appendix II (international). Wild harvesting of orchids (e.g. for salep production) has been documented as a pressure on certain populations. This designation is intended as a risk-reduction measure only and does not represent a formal conservation assessment.",
